    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics based planet matching!</h2><br>It is time to tidy up the solar system. Can't have all these planets laying around. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shove planets into each other to make bigger planets<br></li><li>No stress, take your time<br></li><li>Like Suika Game but more forgiving and extra features<br></li><li>Play strategically to trigger insane combos<br></li><li>Earn missiles to get out of tricky situations<br></li><li>Totally accurate simulation of celestial bodies</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips and tricks</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use smaller planets to nudge bigger ones<br></li><li>You get more points for chaining collapses. Try to line up planets in the correct order before collapsing them all<br></li><li>Keep it tidy, lots of small planets will make the end game difficult<br></li><li>Use your missiles wisely, they can be a total game changer</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics based planet matching!</h2><br>It is time to tidy up the solar system. Can't have all these planets laying around. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Shove planets into each other to make bigger planets<br></li><li>No stress, take your time<br></li><li>Like Suika Game but more forgiving and extra features<br></li><li>Play strategically to trigger insane combos<br></li><li>Earn missiles to get out of tricky situations<br></li><li>Totally accurate simulation of celestial bodies</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips and tricks</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use smaller planets to nudge bigger ones<br></li><li>You get more points for chaining collapses. Try to line up planets in the correct order before collapsing them all<br></li><li>Keep it tidy, lots of small planets will make the end game difficult<br></li><li>Use your missiles wisely, they can be a total game changer</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Merge planets together in this puzzle game with soft physics. Can you make it to the sun? Can you merge two suns? Find out for science!",
